  "title": "There is a mountain in Estonia!",
  "date": "2026-08-28T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "There is a mountain in Estonia!\n\nToday, I went to hike in Viimsi. We started from Merivälja Pier. It is very near to Pirita beach. From there I can see a full view of Tallinn city.\n\nMerivälja Pier\n\nIt is almost automn. Locals will put some spare apples outside for people to eat freely.\n\napples\n\nYou ca ncheck some nice decorations for their houses.\n\nLocal decoration\n\nThis is a frog dragon scalpture.\n\nFrog Dragon\n\nThere is a gallery on the way.\n\nContemporaryArtGallery\n\nThe cave was built in the soviet time. And there are containers for submarines.\n\nKuradi- ehk Röövlikoobas cave\n\nEventually, there is a small ski zone\n\nVimka - Viimsi Mäepark",
